---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { owner } from '../data/owner.mjs';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Terms of Use | CheckVitalsNow"
  description="The terms that apply when you use CheckVitalsNow, including our medical disclaimer, intellectual property, and limits of liability."
  h1="Terms of Use"
>
  <p>
    These Terms of Use apply to your use of {site.name} ({site.url.replace('https://', '')}){owner.name && <>, operated by {owner.name}</>}.
    By using the site, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.
  </p>

  <h2>Information only, not medical advice</h2>
  <p>
    All content on {site.name} is for general information only and is not medical advice. Always talk to a qualified
    health professional before making changes to your health routine or treatment. See our
    <a href="/medical-disclaimer/">medical disclaimer</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
  <p>
    Our guides link to outside sources, such as government health agencies and medical journals, so you can check what
    we write. We do not own or control those websites and are not responsible for their content or privacy practices.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy of information</h2>
  <p>
    We work to keep our content accurate, but medical research and guidance change. Content is provided "as is,"
    without warranties of any kind, and we do not guarantee that it is complete, current, or free of errors.
  </p>

  <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    The text, design, and original graphics on {site.name} belong to us or are used with permission. You may read,
    share links to, and quote short passages from our content with credit and a link back. Please do not copy or
    republish whole articles without written permission. Names and trademarks of
    organizations mentioned on the site belong to their respective owners.
  </p>

  <h2>Comments</h2>
  <p>
    You can comment on our guides. Every comment is reviewed before it appears, and we may edit out personal details or
    decline any comment. Comments must not include links, email addresses, phone numbers, advertising, or anything
    hateful, harassing, or misleading. Comments from readers are their own views, not medical advice and not the views
    of {site.name}. By posting, you give us permission to show your comment on the site.
  </p>

  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>
    Do not use the site in a way that breaks the law, harms the site or other users, or tries to get around its security,
    including heavy automated scraping.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the fullest extent allowed by law, {site.name} and the people who run it are not liable for any loss or damage
    that results from your use of the site or from relying on its content, including health decisions made without the
    advice of a qualified professional.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms. The "Last updated" date at the top shows when they last changed. Continuing to use the
    site after a change means you accept the new terms.
  </p>

  {
    owner.jurisdiction && (
      <>
        <h2>Governing law</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by the laws of {owner.jurisdiction}.</p>
      </>
    )
  }

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms? Reach us through our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
